              ":question/id": "15c029df-b002-51cc-87db-a94d40a02771",
              ":question/math-academy-id": "e-595",
              ":question/problem": "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=\\cos{t}, \\quad y=\\sin{t}, \\qquad  0\\leq t<2\\pi,\n$$\n\n calculate $\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}.$\n\n![](images/2e/2ec95dd061fa6b7f09c9f899a1f6483b4ea7d5127372ddd6eefb74d6ed10c14c.png)",
              ":question/worked-solution": "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x} = \\dfrac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t) = -\\sin{t}, \\qquad y'(t)=\\cos{t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x} = \\dfrac{\\cos t}{-\\sin t} = -\\cot t.\n$$"
            },
            ":knowledge-point/id": "8922ab07-5ac7-5f85-bfee-c30de7f4024a",
            ":knowledge-point/title": "Finding the Derivative of a Parametric Curve"
          },
          {
            ":db/id": 17592186083243,
            ":knowledge-point/canonical-example": {
              ":db/id": 17592186083055,
              ":question/id": "148e5378-9177-59ba-9b1e-3633c940babd",
              ":question/math-academy-id": "e-596",
              ":question/problem": "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=te^t, \\quad y=e^{-t}, \\qquad -\\infty < t <\\infty,\n$$\n\ncalculate the slope of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=1.$",
              ":question/worked-solution": "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x} = \\dfrac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t) = e^t + te^t = (1+t)e^t, \\qquad y'(t)=-e^{-t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{-{e}^{-t}}{(1+t){e}^{t}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{(1+t){e}^{2t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=1,$ the slope of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{dy}{dx}|}_{t=1} & =-\\frac{1}{{e}^{2(1)}(1+1)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2{e}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
            },
            ":knowledge-point/id": "d0bda136-40a9-576a-b85c-4d4ebefaeb27",
            ":knowledge-point/title": "Calculating the Slope of the Tangent to a Parametric Curve at a Given Point"
          }
